menu "PrismPath mesh node"

config PPT_MESH_EXPIRY_HOLD
    bool "Keep deciding under an expired release (HOLD) instead of refusing (REFUSE)"
    default n
    help
        The expiry response of policy distribution (spec-policy-distribution.md, X6). Off is REFUSE: an
        expired release lapses and the node decides nothing. On is HOLD: the node keeps deciding under the
        expired release, marks every state record with bit 5 and ends the hold only on a release that passes
        every rule, a revocation, or a lost floor. The setting is fixed for the node's life (X10).

endmenu
